bers all the times he called Krishna simply friend, joked with him, sat and ate with him, without knowing his greatness. Forgive me, he says, as a father forgives his son, as a friend forgives a friend, as a lover forgives the beloved.","start":145.536,"at":146.112,"end":165.072,"words":[[0.113,0.637,"Trembling"],[1.012,0.463,"Arjuna"],[1.488,0.312,"bows"],[1.812,0.388,"again"],[2.212,0.163,"and"],[2.388,0.475,"again"],[3.263,0.1,"He"],[3.375,0.55,"remembers"],[3.938,0.175,"all"],[4.125,0.1,"the"],[4.237,0.412,"times"],[4.662,0.087,"he"],[4.763,0.3,"called"],[5.075,0.45,"Krishna"],[5.537,0.338,"simply"],[5.888,0.45,"friend"],[6.625,0.3,"joked"],[6.938,0.125,"with"],[7.075,0.263,"him"],[7.575,0.287,"sat"],[7.875,0.1,"and"],[7.987,0.188,"ate"],[8.188,0.125,"with"],[8.325,0.237,"him"],[8.812,0.375,"without"],[9.2,0.287,"knowing"],[9.5,0.138,"his"],[9.65,0.688,"greatness"],[10.725,0.425,"Forgive"],[11.162,0.25,"me"],[11.588,0.113,"he"],[11.713,0.412,"says"],[12.363,0.163,"as"],[12.537,0.062,"a"],[12.613,0.412,"father"],[13.037,0.375,"forgives"],[13.425,0.15,"his"],[13.588,0.388,"son"],[14.238,0.163,"as"],[14.412,0.062,"a"],[14.488,0.375,"friend"],[14.875,0.338,"forgives"],[15.225,0.062,"a"],[15.3,0.45,"friend"],[16.038,0.125,"as"],[16.175,0.05,"a"],[16.238,0.362,"lover"],[16.613,0.4,"forgives"],[17.025,0.087,"the"],[17.125,0.6,"beloved"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"Back to the gentle form","visual":["Show me again your four-armed form","Krishna returns to his gentle human form","Arjuna: now I am calm again"],"L":["L4"],"say":"I am delighted to have seen what no one has seen before, Arjuna says, but my mind is shaken with fear. Please show me your gentle form again. And Krishna does. He shows his four-armed form, and then returns to his familiar human shape and consoles his frightened friend. Seeing you like this, Arjuna says, I am calm again.","start":165.072,"at":165.648,"end":187.536,"words":[[0.138,0.113,"I"],[0.263,0.125,"am"],[0.4,0.537,"delighted"],[0.95,0.087